  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I depend on mods for my creativity in this game because the devs can't provide me with the tools I need for taking the quality of photos and videos i want to take.\nPlease add the following features to the game:\n- set the picture/video quality preferable up to 8K\n- Option to make the cam-screen bigger\n- lighting options\n- flash\n- ability to remove the shutter-sound\nYou can take inspiration from the settings of a Sony a7 III -  all the different capabilities it provides, e.g. see where the cam is all focused on with dots/lines.\nSpecific: for video: set the path, where the cam follows with different speeds, pre set path, e.g. circles that are easy adjustable in size and axle. \nI can assume a lot of streamers have special needs, though and input on this subject too! e.g. the abilty to add the chat under the camera, ability to hide players based on their rank.... \nIf you have any ideas just leave a comment.",
